OL,3,GNEWSAGrieving friends speak of love for
OL,4,Acancer patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree friends of a cancer patient who
OL,7,Fdied a week after he turned 20 have
OL,8,Fspoken of their love for him.
OL,10,FLeo Firth, from Crawley, in West
OL,11,FSussex, was diagnosed with acute
OL,12,Fmyeloid leukaemia (AML), a rare cancer
OL,13,Fof the blood and bone marrow, in 2023.
OL,15,FAfter undergoing several rounds of
OL,16,Fchemotherapy, as well as radiotherapy
OL,17,Fand a stem cell transplant, treatment
OL,18,Foptions ran out and he died on 31
OL,19,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
