OL,3,GNEWSAGrieving friends speak of love for
OL,4,Acancer patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow his friends, Max Miller, Jakub
OL,7,FMihal and Elliot Hounslow have spoken
OL,8,Fout to highlight the importance of
OL,9,Ftalking about grief.
